# Tests for the Form1099_rs module

Run with `clerk test`. Concrete cases of issue #22, worked out by hand from
the Direct File definitions quoted in `catala/form1099_rs.catala_en`, and
rejected bad outputs. The oracle comparison is
`make difftest SCOPE=form1099_rs`.

> Using Types
> Using Form1099_rs as F

## Helper: a 1099-R with every box defaulting to a plain code 7 form

Each test overrides only what it fills in.

```catala
declaration scope MkR:
  context filer content Types.FilerRole
  context distribution_code content list of F.CodeChar
  context writable_gross_distribution content money
  context writable_taxable_amount content money
  context taxable_amount_blank content boolean
  context taxable_amount_not_determined content boolean
  context total_distribution content boolean
  context writable_capital_gain content money
  context writable_federal_withholding content money
  context writable_net_appreciation content money
  context ira_sep_simple content boolean
  context writable_other_dollar content money
  context other_percentage_nonzero content boolean
  context percentage_total_distribution_nonzero content boolean
  context writable_amount_allocable_to_irr content money
  context facta_filing_requirement content boolean
  context writable_state_tax_withheld content money
  context payer_state_is_different content boolean
  context has_death_benefit_payment_date content boolean
  context writable_is_indirect_rollover content boolean
  context writable_is_distribution_from_military_retirement_plan content boolean
  context writable_qualified_disaster_distribution content boolean
  context writeable_public_safety_officer content boolean
  context writeable_public_safety_officer_premiums content boolean
  context recipient_date_of_birth content date
  output form content F.Form1099R

scope MkR:
  definition filer equals Types.FilerRole.PrimaryFiler
  definition distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.Code7]
  definition writable_gross_distribution equals $0
  definition writable_taxable_amount equals $0
  definition taxable_amount_blank equals false
  definition taxable_amount_not_determined equals false
  definition total_distribution equals false
  definition writable_capital_gain equals $0
  definition writable_federal_withholding equals $0
  definition writable_net_appreciation equals $0
  definition ira_sep_simple equals false
  definition writable_other_dollar equals $0
  definition other_percentage_nonzero equals false
  definition percentage_total_distribution_nonzero equals false
  definition writable_amount_allocable_to_irr equals $0
  definition facta_filing_requirement equals false
  definition writable_state_tax_withheld equals $0
  definition payer_state_is_different equals false
  definition has_death_benefit_payment_date equals false
  definition writable_is_indirect_rollover equals false
  definition writable_is_distribution_from_military_retirement_plan equals false
  definition writable_qualified_disaster_distribution equals false
  definition writeable_public_safety_officer equals false
  definition writeable_public_safety_officer_premiums equals false
  definition recipient_date_of_birth equals |1964-08-02|
  definition form equals F.Form1099R {
    -- filer: filer
    -- distribution_code: distribution_code
    -- writable_gross_distribution: writable_gross_distribution
    -- writable_taxable_amount: writable_taxable_amount
    -- taxable_amount_blank: taxable_amount_blank
    -- taxable_amount_not_determined: taxable_amount_not_determined
    -- total_distribution: total_distribution
    -- writable_capital_gain: writable_capital_gain
    -- writable_federal_withholding: writable_federal_withholding
    -- writable_net_appreciation: writable_net_appreciation
    -- ira_sep_simple: ira_sep_simple
    -- writable_other_dollar: writable_other_dollar
    -- other_percentage_nonzero: other_percentage_nonzero
    -- percentage_total_distribution_nonzero: percentage_total_distribution_nonzero
    -- writable_amount_allocable_to_irr: writable_amount_allocable_to_irr
    -- facta_filing_requirement: facta_filing_requirement
    -- writable_state_tax_withheld: writable_state_tax_withheld
    -- payer_state_is_different: payer_state_is_different
    -- has_death_benefit_payment_date: has_death_benefit_payment_date
    -- writable_is_indirect_rollover: writable_is_indirect_rollover
    -- writable_is_distribution_from_military_retirement_plan: writable_is_distribution_from_military_retirement_plan
    -- writable_qualified_disaster_distribution: writable_qualified_disaster_distribution
    -- writeable_public_safety_officer: writeable_public_safety_officer
    -- writeable_public_safety_officer_premiums: writeable_public_safety_officer_premiums
    -- recipient_date_of_birth: recipient_date_of_birth
  }
```

## Code 7, gross $10,000, taxable $10,000: fully taxable

Line 5b only; "don't make an entry on line 5a" (i1040gi--2024.pdf p 28).

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestFullyTaxable:
  a scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestFullyTaxable:
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $10,000
  definition a.writable_taxable_amount equals $10,000
  definition r.forms equals [a.form]
  assertion r.fully_taxable_pensions = $10,000
  assertion r.partly_taxable_pensions = $0
  assertion r.line_5a = $0
  assertion r.line_5b = $10,000
  # A bad output: the fully taxable gross is not on line 5a.
  assertion not (r.line_5a = $10,000)
  assertion not r.line_5b_is_blank
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

## Code 7, gross $10,000, taxable $6,000: partly taxable

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestPartlyTaxable:
  a scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestPartlyTaxable:
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $10,000
  definition a.writable_taxable_amount equals $6,000
  definition r.forms equals [a.form]
  assertion r.partly_taxable_pensions = $10,000
  assertion r.fully_taxable_pensions = $0
  assertion r.line_5a = $10,000
  assertion r.line_5b = $6,000
  assertion r.non_taxable_pensions_and_annuities = $4,000
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

## Code G, direct rollover, taxable $0: tax-free rollover

Gross on line 5a, line 5b is $0 (shown as zero, not blank) with "ROLLOVER".

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestTaxFreeRollover:
  a scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestTaxFreeRollover:
  definition a.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.CodeG]
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $4,000
  definition r.forms equals [a.form]
  assertion r.tax_free_pension_rollovers = $4,000
  assertion r.line_5a = $4,000
  assertion r.line_5b = $0
  assertion not r.line_5b_is_blank
  assertion r.has_direct_rollover
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

A rollover with a taxable amount above $0 is not supported (a taxable
rollover and a pre-tax to post-tax rollover).

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestTaxableRolloverRejected:
  a scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestTaxableRolloverRejected:
  definition a.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.CodeH]
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $4,000
  definition a.writable_taxable_amount equals $500
  definition r.forms equals [a.form]
  assertion r.ko_knockout_taxable_pension_rollover
  assertion r.ko_flow_knockout_for_pre_tax_to_post_tax_rollover
  assertion r.unsupported
```

## Code 1 and other unsupported codes

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestCodeOneUnsupported:
  a scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestCodeOneUnsupported:
  definition a.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.OtherCode]
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $10,000
  definition a.writable_taxable_amount equals $10,000
  definition r.forms equals [a.form]
  assertion r.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_distribution_code
  assertion r.unsupported
```

DF-BUG(1): `7D` is a knockout here, though Direct File strips it to `7`.
So are an empty box, a repeated code and `27`, while `7B`, `B7` and `4G` are
supported.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestWholeCode:
  seven_d scope MkR
  empty scope MkR
  seven_seven scope MkR
  two_seven scope MkR
  seven_b scope MkR
  b_seven scope MkR
  four_g scope MkR
  four_alone scope MkR
  r1 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r2 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r3 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r4 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r5 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r6 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r7 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r8 scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestWholeCode:
  definition seven_d.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.Code7; F.CodeChar.OtherCode]
  definition empty.distribution_code equals []
  definition seven_seven.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.Code7; F.CodeChar.Code7]
  definition two_seven.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.Code2; F.CodeChar.Code7]
  definition seven_b.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.Code7; F.CodeChar.CodeB]
  definition b_seven.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.CodeB; F.CodeChar.Code7]
  definition four_g.distribution_code equals
    [F.CodeChar.Code4; F.CodeChar.CodeG]
  definition four_alone.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.Code4]
  definition r1.forms equals [seven_d.form]
  definition r2.forms equals [empty.form]
  definition r3.forms equals [seven_seven.form]
  definition r4.forms equals [two_seven.form]
  definition r5.forms equals [seven_b.form]
  definition r6.forms equals [b_seven.form]
  definition r7.forms equals [four_g.form]
  definition r8.forms equals [four_alone.form]
  assertion r1.unsupported
  assertion r2.unsupported
  assertion r3.unsupported
  assertion r4.unsupported
  assertion not r5.unsupported
  assertion not r6.unsupported
  assertion not r7.unsupported
  assertion r8.unsupported
```

## Oracle case (scenario `1040-withholdings-without-attachments`)

Three forms: `GB` gross $57,992.81 taxable $0 (rollover), `7` gross $12,992.75
taxable $9,122.04 with $911.75 withheld (partly taxable), `7B` gross $20,000
taxable $20,000 with $1,507.51 withheld (fully taxable). The oracle has
5a = $70,986, 5b = $29,122 and the 1099 withholding $2,420 = 912 + 1,508
(boxes rounded one by one). Line 5a is $57,993 + $12,993.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestOracleWithholdingsScenario:
  a scope MkR
  b scope MkR
  c scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestOracleWithholdingsScenario:
  definition a.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.CodeG; F.CodeChar.CodeB]
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $57,992.81
  definition b.writable_gross_distribution equals $12,992.75
  definition b.writable_taxable_amount equals $9,122.04
  definition b.writable_federal_withholding equals $911.75
  definition c.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.Code7; F.CodeChar.CodeB]
  definition c.writable_gross_distribution equals $20,000
  definition c.writable_taxable_amount equals $20,000
  definition c.writable_federal_withholding equals $1,507.51
  definition r.forms equals [a.form; b.form; c.form]
  assertion r.line_5a = $70,986
  assertion r.line_5b = $29,122
  assertion r.form_1099r_federal_income_tax_withheld = $2,420
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

## Form 8880 line 4 inputs

Per filer, codes 2, 7, 2B, B2, 7B, B7 only, no military plan; rollovers are
out (Form 8880 instructions, f8880--2024.pdf p 2).

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestSaversDistributions:
  a scope MkR
  b scope MkR
  c scope MkR
  d scope MkR
  r scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestSaversDistributions:
  definition a.writable_gross_distribution equals $4,000.49
  definition a.writable_taxable_amount equals $3,000
  definition b.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.CodeB; F.CodeChar.CodeG]
  definition b.writable_gross_distribution equals $5,000
  definition c.filer equals Types.FilerRole.SecondaryFiler
  definition c.distribution_code equals [F.CodeChar.CodeB; F.CodeChar.Code2]
  definition c.writable_gross_distribution equals $1,200
  definition c.writable_taxable_amount equals $1,000
  definition d.writable_gross_distribution equals $900
  definition d.writable_taxable_amount equals $900
  definition d.writable_is_distribution_from_military_retirement_plan equals true
  definition r.forms equals [a.form; b.form; c.form; d.form]
  assertion r.primary_filer_savers_gross_distributions = $4,000
  assertion r.secondary_filer_savers_gross_distributions = $1,200
  assertion not r.unsupported
```

## Knockouts

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestKnockouts:
  base scope MkR
  ira scope MkR
  cg scope MkR
  nua scope MkR
  b8 scope MkR
  b8zero scope MkR
  b15 scope MkR
  pso scope MkR
  fac scope MkR
  r0 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r1 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r2 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r3 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r4 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r5 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r6 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r7 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r8 scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestKnockouts:
  definition ira.ira_sep_simple equals true
  definition cg.writable_capital_gain equals $1
  definition nua.writable_net_appreciation equals $1
  definition b8.other_percentage_nonzero equals true
  definition b8zero.other_percentage_nonzero equals false
  definition b15.payer_state_is_different equals true
  definition b15.writable_state_tax_withheld equals $17
  definition pso.writeable_public_safety_officer equals true
  definition pso.writeable_public_safety_officer_premiums equals true
  definition fac.facta_filing_requirement equals true
  definition r0.forms equals [base.form; b8zero.form]
  definition r1.forms equals [ira.form]
  definition r2.forms equals [cg.form]
  definition r3.forms equals [nua.form]
  definition r4.forms equals [b8.form]
  definition r5.forms equals [b15.form]
  definition r6.forms equals [pso.form]
  definition r7.forms equals [fac.form]
  definition r8.forms equals [base.form]
  # A zero percentage in box 8 is not a knockout (see DF-BUG proposal 7).
  assertion not r0.unsupported
  assertion r1.ko_knockout_ira_sep_simple
  assertion r2.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_capital_gain
  assertion r3.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_net_unrealized_appreciation
  assertion r4.ko_knockout_for_form1099_r_box8_percentage
  assertion r5.ko_flow_knockout_box15
  assertion r6.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_public_safety_officer
  assertion r7.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_facta_filing_requirement
  assertion r1.unsupported and r2.unsupported and r3.unsupported
  assertion r4.unsupported and r5.unsupported and r6.unsupported
  assertion r7.unsupported
  assertion not r8.unsupported
```

A total distribution is a knockout only for a recipient born before
1936-01-02.

```catala
#[test]
declaration scope TestTotalDistribution:
  old scope MkR
  young scope MkR
  r1 scope F.Form1099Rs
  r2 scope F.Form1099Rs

scope TestTotalDistribution:
  definition old.total_distribution equals true
  definition old.recipient_date_of_birth equals |1935-12-31|
  definition young.total_distribution equals true
  definition r1.forms equals [old.form]
  definition r2.forms equals [young.form]
  assertion r1.ko_flow_knockout_retirement_total_distribution
  assertion not r2.unsupported
```
